<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 14.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 14.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 14	     April 11</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.858		  5.277</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  11.858		  6.173</p>
<p>Cash balance		  17.716		 11.449</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,292.166	     5,291.406</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $8 million were issued and $43 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
